sequenceDiagram
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant H as Handler +<br/>HTTP wrapper
  participant S as Operation +<br/>notes service
  participant R as Repository
  participant D as DynamoDB
  G->>H: PUT /notes/{id},<br/>body, claims.sub
  Note over H: caller = claims.sub,<br/>check token_use and scope
  H->>S: validate id, body
  S->>R: update(owner = sub,<br/>id, fields, version?)
  R->>D: UpdateItem IF exists<br/>AND userId = :sub<br/>[AND version = :v]
  alt condition satisfied
    D-->>R: updated item
    R-->>H: note
    H-->>G: 200 {"data": note}<br/>+ JSON log line
  else condition failed
    D-->>R: stored item<br/>(ALL_OLD) or none
    R-->>S: old item
    S-->>H: AppError<br/>404 / 403 / 409
    H-->>G: error envelope with<br/>requestId + log line
  end
